<title>USA: CNA FINANCIAL BUYS ARGENTINA INSURER.</title>
<headline>CNA FINANCIAL BUYS ARGENTINA INSURER.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Financial Corp and Argentina's Omega Cooperativa de Seguros completed a deal for CNA to buy a 70 percent stake in Omega, marking CNA's first venture in Argentina.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Omega Seguros is the leading property and casualty insurer in Argentina with approximately six percent of the market.</p>
<p>Friday, 27 June 1997 22:26:04</p>
